{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["當烏西雅、約坦、亞哈斯、希西家作猶大王，約阿施的兒子耶羅波安作以色列王的時候，耶和華的話臨到備利的兒子何西阿。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿的妻子和兒女"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華初次與何西阿說話，對他說：「你去娶淫婦為妻，也收那從淫亂所生的兒女；因為這地大行淫亂，離棄耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["於是，何西阿去娶了滴拉音的女兒歌篾。這婦人懷孕，給他生了一個兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華對何西阿說：「給他起名叫耶斯列；因為再過片時，我必討耶戶家在耶斯列殺人流血的罪，也必使以色列家的國滅絕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["到那日，我必在耶斯列平原折斷以色列的弓。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["歌篾又懷孕生了一個女兒，耶和華對何西阿說：「給她起名叫羅‧路哈瑪",{"noteId":0},"；因為我必不再憐憫以色列家，決不赦免他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我卻要憐憫猶大家，使他們靠耶和華－他們的上帝得救，不使他們靠弓、刀、爭戰、馬匹，與馬兵得救。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["歌篾給羅‧路哈瑪斷奶以後，又懷孕生了一個兒子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華說：「給他起名叫羅‧阿米",{"noteId":1},"；因為你們不作我的子民，我也不作你們的上帝。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列將要復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["然而，以色列的人數必如海沙，不可量，不可數。從前在甚麼地方對他們說「你們不是我的子民」，將來在那裏必對他們說「你們是永生上帝的兒子」。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["猶大人和以色列人必一同聚集，為自己立一個首領，從這地上去",{"noteId":2},"，因為耶斯列的日子必為大日。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"就是不蒙憐憫的意思","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"就是非我民的意思","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：從被擄之地上來","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DAN/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}